# Canonical assets seeded from icm-board — kept byte-identical to the template
.claude/

# Immutable records — pipeline run artifacts are written once and kept verbatim; reformatting
# them rewrites history for no benefit.
.icm/runs/

# Template-owned pipeline files — byte-identical with the estate template in icm-board
# (`_system/template/icm-pipeline/MANIFEST`, estate decision D20) and synced from it by
# `icm-sync.sh`. A formatter pass here would put them out of step with every other repo and read
# as drift; they are edited in the template, never in place. `.claude/` above covers the router.
.icm/stages/
.icm/lanes/
.icm/_shared/
.icm/skills/
.icm/uat/
.icm/raw/
.icm/intake/CONTEXT.md
.icm/MANIFEST
.github/pull_request_template.md

# Compiled by the pipeline's own scripts, never by hand — `process-raw.sh` writes `.icm/processed/`,
# `client-status.sh` writes `.icm/output/`; formatting either only churns a generated file.
.icm/processed/
.icm/output/
